<fw type="catch" place="bottom">57. Seine</fw><lb/>
<pb n="152" facs="#f0174"/>
<lg n="57"><l>57. Seine gottesfu&#x0364;rchtige Gemahlin <hi rendition="#g">Su&#x017F;anne</hi></l><lb/>
